  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n - Iterative tasks are now available as an experimental feature (#4210)\r\n - Terminal width and the `rc.defaultwidth` are now handled better in task burndown (#4225, #4226, #4227, #4230)\r\n - Annotations widths are handled correctly in reports (#4233)\r\n - The task projects output now correctly nests projects (#4232)\r\n - The OR operator is now rejected in contexts, as it behaves differently for read and write (#4229)\r\n - Setting LIBSQLITE3_SYS_USE_PKG_CONFIG when building will link to the system SQLite library (#4223)\r\n - Dashes are now allowed in rc.* DOM references (#4197)\r\n - Wrapped annotation lines in task list reports now retain their indentation (#4189)\r\n - S3-compatible storage backends can be used with the new rc.sync.aws.endpoint_url config (#4176)\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @freswa made their first contribution in https://github.com/GothenburgBitFactory/taskwarrior/pull/4176\r\n* @gregbell made their first contribution in https://github.com/GothenburgBitFactory/taskwarrior/pull/4189\r\n* @swardman made their first contribution in https://github.com/GothenburgBitFactory/taskwarrior/pull/4190\r\n* @brzzdev made their first contribution in https://github.com/GothenburgBitFactory/taskwarrior/pull/4200\r\n* @RayanR000 made their first contribution in https://github.com/GothenburgBitFactory/taskwarrior/pull/4197\r\n* @jatinninety9 made their first contribution in https://github.com/GothenburgBitFactory/taskwarrior/pull/4225\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/GothenburgBitFactory/taskwarrior/compare/v3.5.0...v3.6.0",
